{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cater Co. is a <strong>stress-free</strong> <strong>cooking management</strong> game where you cut, mix, and cook the ingredients to fulfill your customers' orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin by inheriting a small catering shop from a stranger.\u00a0Grow your business, uncover the mystery of Cater Co\u2019s previous owner, and learn more about the lives of your returning customers. There are over 100+ recipes to discover, each building upon each-other, and automate your kitchen to streamline production.\u00a0Everything is at your own pace. There are no timers. Take your time designing your kitchen, experimenting with automation, and exploring recipes. Earn money to unlock upgrades and expand your catering business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/ad30cc3c54da7d9a1d65c2f24e932b82.poster.avif?t=1764734546\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/ad30cc3c54da7d9a1d65c2f24e932b82.webm?t=1764734546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/ad30cc3c54da7d9a1d65c2f24e932b82.mp4?t=1764734546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Follow the stories of your returning customers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/bf35153e105771da6008623c250f6228.avif?t=1764734546\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Over 100 hand-drawn recipes to discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/2bdbed14df941955e172d9155d64d4f3.avif?t=1764734546\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FAQ: What is the &quot;Cat&quot; for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He's a good looking cat. (And if you feed him, he gives you recipes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/fa54de8c8e1be5600907bc21c3eea3a3.poster.avif?t=1764734546\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/fa54de8c8e1be5600907bc21c3eea3a3.webm?t=1764734546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/fa54de8c8e1be5600907bc21c3eea3a3.mp4?t=1764734546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recipe Automation:</strong> Plan, design, and automate your kitchen to your heart\u2019s content.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Gameplay:</strong> No timers \u2014 play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Expand:</strong> Earn money to improve your equipment and unlock new possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesome Story:</strong> Discover the mysteries behind your inheritance and connect with charming returning customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn Graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Looking Cat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934330?t=1764734546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/4937a2bae09f042da9f6a72188c0b67900a04310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764734546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/2df87ba25704cb99f52309891a1cbfe72e780d3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764734546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/2df87ba25704cb99f52309891a1cbfe72e780d3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764734546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cater Co. is a <strong>stress-free</strong> <strong>cooking management</strong> game where you cut, mix, and cook the ingredients to fulfill your customers' orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin by inheriting a small catering shop from a stranger.\u00a0Grow your business, uncover the mystery of Cater Co\u2019s previous owner, and learn more about the lives of your returning customers. There are over 100+ recipes to discover, each building upon each-other, and automate your kitchen to streamline production.\u00a0Everything is at your own pace. There are no timers. Take your time designing your kitchen, experimenting with automation, and exploring recipes. Earn money to unlock upgrades and expand your catering business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_